## Phase 2: Systemic Prevention (Week 2) 🛡️

### Core Features

#### Commitment Scanner
- [ ] Auto-detect patterns:
  - [ ] "Board Decision" headers in artifacts
  - [ ] `- [ ]` unchecked items in any [.md](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/AGENTS.md) file
  - [ ] Files with "draft" or "ready to post" in name
  - [ ] "TODO" markers in code/docs
- [ ] Extract commitment metadata (date, who, what, deadline)
- [ ] Write to commitment_ledger.json

#### Aging Analyzer
- [ ] Calculate days elapsed for each commitment
- [ ] Classify by tier (🟢<3d, 🟡3-7d, 🔴>7d)
- [ ] Generate escalation messages
- [ ] Surface in Satellite View

#### Quick Close Workflow
- [ ] Generate pre-filled closure options:
  - [ ] "Do now" (with time estimate)
  - [ ] "Schedule" (with suggested date/time)
  - [ ] "Archive" (with suggested reason)
  - [ ] "Kill" (with suggested rationale)
  - [ ] "Delegate" (with suggested agent/person)
- [ ] One-click approval mechanism
- [ ] Auto-execute approved closures

#### Context-Aware Routing (Agentgraph Enhancement)
- [ ] Add context dimensions to commitment data:
  - [ ] Novelty level (first-time vs. repetitive)
  - [ ] Dopamine level (estimated: fun vs. boring)
  - [ ] Urgency (deadline-based)
  - [ ] Emotional load (guilt score)
- [ ] Build routing logic:
  - [ ] High novelty → Always escalate to Chairman
  - [ ] Low dopamine → AI pre-starts work, shows progress
  - [ ] High repetition + high confidence → Auto-execute
- [ ] Track routing decisions for learning loop

#### Pattern Template Library (Agentgraph Enhancement)
- [ ] Define commitment templates:
  - [ ] `External_Marketing_Post` (Reddit, Twitter, etc.)
  - [ ] `Creative_Asset_Production` (videos, diagrams, etc.)
  - [ ] `Technical_Debt_Cleanup` (bugs, refactors)
  - [ ] `Research_Validation` (interviews, testing)
- [ ] Store successful closure patterns per template
- [ ] Auto-suggest template on new commitment detection
- [ ] Track template success rates

#### Nightly Digest
- [ ] Add commitment check to [nightly_agent.py](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/scripts/nightly_agent.py)
- [ ] Generate Telegram summary at 11 PM
- [ ] Include: aging count, quick wins, escalations
- [ ] Link to next morning's briefing

### Integration with Existing Tools

#### Satellite View Enhancement
- [ ] Add "Commitment Health" section
- [ ] Show: open loops count, oldest commitment, red-tier count
- [ ] Color-code by health
- [ ] Add coordination efficiency metric (avg time-to-closure)

#### Depth Tracker Integration
- [ ] Add "Open Loops" warning when depth >3
- [ ] Show breadcrumb: "...and 5 open commitments behind you"

#### Feature Map Integration
- [ ] Link commitments to features
- [ ] Show "commitment → feature → proof" chain

### Agentgraph Enhancements

#### Coordination Metrics Dashboard
- [ ] Build metrics collector:
  - [ ] Coordination efficiency (time from made → closed)
  - [ ] Capability utilization (% deep work vs. execution)
  - [ ] Learning velocity (week-over-week auto-closure rate)
  - [ ] Execution success rate (% done vs. archived/killed)
  - [ ] Mental load (self-reported weekly)
- [ ] Create visualization in Satellite View:
  - [ ] Trend graphs for key metrics
  - [ ] Week-over-week comparison
  - [ ] Highlight improvements in green
- [ ] Export to weekly digest

#### Graceful Degradation
- [ ] Build fallback chain for notifications:
  - [ ] Primary: Telegram
  - [ ] Backup: Email
  - [ ] Emergency: SMS (optional)
  - [ ] Last resort: File in Dropbox
- [ ] Add health monitoring:
  - [ ] Track: Briefing delivered? Reviewed? Acted on?
  - [ ] Alert if 3 consecutive misses
- [ ] Test failover scenarios

